<view class="container"><view wx:if="{{config.demo}}" class="demo">本机演示版 · 示例商品不是真实在售物品</view><view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">给闲置一次新的出发</text><text class="hero-title">你的闲置，
恰好是我的心头好。</text><text class="muted">让好物在校园里流动，让每一份喜欢都有回响。</text><view class="hero-tags">✦ 免费发布　↔ 当面交易　♡ 循环使用</view></view><view class="row"><text class="section-title">发现校园好物</text><button class="primary" size="mini" bindtap="publish">＋ 发布闲置</button></view><view class="search"><input placeholder="搜名称、简介，发现你的心头好" maxlength="80" value="{{query}}" bindinput="inputSearch" bindconfirm="search" confirm-type="search"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="search">搜索</button></view><scroll-view class="categories" scroll-x><text wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{category === item || (!category &amp;&amp; index === 0) ? 'active' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="category">{{item}}</text></scroll-view><view class="grid"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="detail"><image class="card-img" mode="aspectFill" src="{{item.photos[0].url}}" lazy-load/><view class="card-body"><view class="card-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="row"><text class="price">¥{{item.priceLabel}}</text><text class="tag">{{item.delivery === 'pickup' ? '校园自取' : '支持送达'}}</text></view><view class="card-meta">{{item.seller_name}}</view></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!loading &amp;&amp; !items.length}}" class="empty">{{error || '暂时没有找到好物，换个关键词试试。'}}<button wx:if="{{error}}" class="secondary" bindtap="search">重新加载</button></view><view class="loading">{{loading ? '正在加载…' : hasMore ? '上拉发现更多好物' : '让校园里的好物继续被喜欢'}}</view></view>
